        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9005, Thin Modern Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe sleekness of Omnia's 9005 Cabinet Pull allows it to look great in almost any décor. The thinness of this cabinet pull is gives it a unobtrusive look, only adding to its contemporary appeal. Beautifully crafted, this cabinet pull is available in 3 lengths ranging from 4 to 8 inches. It is constructed out of solid brass and is available in satin nickel, polished chrome, and oil-rubbed bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSince this simple cabinet pull is so easy to clean it will maintain a smooth, rich luster for the lifetime of your home; and just like all Omnia's brass cabinet pulls, it will prove worthy of the exceptional standards that Omnia has sustained for more than 40 years.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-cabinet-pull-omnia-9006\"><b>Modern Cabinet Pull Width a Wider Width</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-appliance-pull-omnia-9006p-440\"><b>Matching \"C\" Shaped Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Skinny Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Lengths:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9005/96:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 3-3/4\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>9005/146:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 5-3/4\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>9005/197:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 7-3/4\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
